# Ignore Vivado project files
*.xpr
*.hw
*.sim
*.ip_user_files
*.xd
*.cache
*.data
*.jou
*.log
*.str
*.dcp
*.bd
*.bdxml
*.bit
*.bin
*.ltx
*.svf
*.vds
*.veo
*.vhi
*.vho
